The Fixer is a demonic figure who stepped through the fountain of blood in the hall of [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]] on the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], while the Scale delvers fought [[Sigzil Haight]]'s servants.

[[Org/The Scale/People/Manuel de la Cruzada|Reverend Warden Manuel de la Cruzada]] knew him by the name.
